note Written because the session sprawled. Five things were being conflated: the legacy Bonfyre estate, the current Aurekai product, this session's maturity work, hand-rolled artefacts from me and from codex, and the Downloads system maps. This states which is authoritative and what dies.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE FIVE THINGS, AND WHICH IS AUTHORITATIVE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

layer aurekai-product
  status AUTHORITATIVE
  what the current generation. Product 'Aurekai', legacy_codename 'Bonfyre', CLI 'akai', release 0.8.0-alpha.1, native runtime 0.8.0-alpha.2, ABI 'bonfyre-abi-v1'
  where ~/repos/aurekai (active, main, 48 dirty) plus 49 repos in the github.com/aurekai org
  scale registry declares 10 families and 138 commands; command-truth-matrix.json classifies native 131, integration-only 109, hyper-delegated 7
  native github.com/aurekai/native-runtime -- 644 files, 202 C sources, 89 operators as cmd/Akai*, categories specialized 14, platform 11, artifacts 11, data 11, media 11, knowledge 11, inference 10, pipeline 9, misc 1
  partners 41 shipped integration repos, one per partner (langchain, temporal, dagster, duckdb, helm, terraform, vscode, ...)
  ruling this is the system. Everything else is measured against it.

layer bonfyre-legacy
  status SUPERSEDED, still load-bearing
  what ~/Documents/Bonfyre, 46,424 files across 36 top-level directories; ~/.bonfyre with 89 bonfyre-* binaries, a 1.0 GB agent-hypervisor and 489 MB of provider-runtimes
  relation cmd/Bonfyre* is the previous generation of cmd/Akai*; the local BonfyreQuery source is 302 lines against upstream AkaiQuery's 276
  ruling do not mature the legacy layer in place. A fix here is worth only what it is worth UPSTREAM.

layer reality-foundry-substrates
  status AUTHORITATIVE, and I ignored it all session
  what architecture/substrate/foundry.yaff plus ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/ -- 13 substrates each carrying a PASSING semantic-proof.json witness: tract, burn, cubecl, restate, feldera, lance, daft, egglog, gigatoken, hydro, automerge, verus, yaff
  ruling local execution, durable execution, incremental views, vector store, context and equality saturation are ALREADY measured with witnesses. I re-derived several by hand.

layer downloads-system-maps
  status REFERENCE
  what seven Gen-10 FULL_SYSTEM_MAP markdown files under ~/Downloads
  contains the 112 Partner Commons profiles, the 82 deep-promoted specialties with Pairs-with, the deep-promotion coverage by hook, the 91 public capability identities
  ruling these are the design record. They are NOT state, and the 41 shipped repos are the real partner surface.

layer session-maturity
  status MIXED -- see disposition below

